%% Fluxo POST /api/v1/process — Fase 2 (back-ends reais)

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Usuário
  participant FE as Frontend Angular
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant P as ms-front-end
  participant S as ms-semantic
  participant B as Back-end LPS

  U->>FE: Código MiniPar + variabilidade + modo
  FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/process
  GW->>PG: INSERT compilation_history (pending)

  GW->>P: POST /parse { sourceCode }
  P-->>GW: AST JSON

  GW->>S: POST /analyze { ast }
  S-->>GW: AST + symbolTable

  alt INTERPRETER
    GW->>B: POST ms-interpreter/execute
  else C ou CPP
    GW->>B: POST ms-codegen-c/generate
  else RUST
    GW->>B: POST ms-codegen-rust/generate
  else ASSEMBLY
    GW->>B: POST ms-codegen-arm/generate
  end
  B-->>GW: output + code

  GW->>PG: UPDATE status, output
  GW-->>FE: ProcessResponse
  FE-->>U: Console (Saída / Símbolos / AST)
